  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Visible use of drones and remotely guided/autonomous systems in attacks raises public and legislative alarm about weaponized and poorly-governed autonomy, prompting governments to accelerate proposals for stricter AI oversight, export controls, and operational constraints on autonomy-capable components.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
