  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained high-intensity drone strikes on ports, warehouses and overland corridors increase insurance and operational risk for firms, prompting planned capex shifts and the relocation of production capacity to jurisdictions perceived as lower‑risk or politically aligned (including BRICS locales).</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_conflict</data>
