  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Elevated military posture drives urgent defense procurement and fast-track contracts for advanced AI capabilities (ISR, autonomy, decision aids), channeling funding and prioritization that speeds development cycles for frontier models among contractors and partnered firms.</data>
