  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in military readiness signals near‑term increases in defense spending for directly involved states and their partners, prompting higher immediate sovereign borrowing to finance operations.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_conflict</data>
  <data key="d39">global_rate_shock</data>
