  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained or repeated fuel and grid outages force cloud/datacenter operators to throttle, postpone or geographically relocate capacity, directly delaying scheduled rollouts and integrations of frontier AI into products and services in affected markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
