  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Acute disruptions to fuel and energy deliveries force manufacturers and logistics providers to reroute production and sourcing away from affected corridors and toward alternative suppliers and logistics hubs, accelerating firms' geographic supply‑chain realignments toward BRICS producers and transit routes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_conflict</data>
  <data key="d39">brics_alignment_growth</data>
