  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Acute disruptions to fuel and gas deliveries raise near‑term inflation expectations and inflation risk premia, directly increasing term premia and pushing up long‑dated sovereign yields.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_conflict</data>
  <data key="d39">global_rate_shock</data>
