  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Escalation of attacks or interdictions at maritime chokepoints delays or blocks deliveries of GPUs, servers, cooling systems and other datacenter hardware, producing capacity shortages and extended training queue times that slow frontier model development.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">gulf_energy_flashpoint</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_safety_race</data>
