  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising market perception of oil-supply risk raises expected operational costs and financing costs for firms, causing companies to postpone or scale down capital-intensive rollouts (datacenter expansions, SaaS deployments) and thereby slow integration of frontier models into products and operations.</data>
