  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising market supply_risk_perception about Gulf-origin energy prompts multinational firms to accelerate on‑shore or near‑shore moves and shift capital expenditure to jurisdictions with more secure energy access, raising corporate_reallocation rates toward BRICS-friendly locations.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">gulf_energy_flashpoint</data>
