  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Heightened regional hostilities prompt governments to impose tighter export controls, security vetting and mandatory oversight on advanced computing and AI transfers citing national security, increasing formal regulatory burdens on frontier developers.</data>
