  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained escalation in Gulf geopolitical_tension leads Gulf states to deepen diplomatic, security and energy partnerships with non-Western powers (e.g., China, Russia), accelerating reorientation toward BRICS-aligned political and economic frameworks.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">gulf_energy_flashpoint</data>
