  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising mandatory compliance, data‑localization and auditing requirements in advanced‑economy jurisdictions raise operational costs and legal risk for multinationals, directly incentivizing relocation of R&amp;D, data centers, or production to BRICS jurisdictions with lighter or more predictable oversight.</data>
