  <data key="d36">Accelerated integration of frontier AI into commercial products quickly increases demand for specialized chips, cooling/hosting capacity and AI services, causing firms to reorganize sourcing and production geography toward suppliers and jurisdictions (including BRICS members) that can meet that surge in capacity or offer favorable terms.</data>
