  <data key="d28">1</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Expanded central‑bank market operations (liquidity provision/asset purchases) lower short‑term funding stress and stabilize asset prices, enabling some firms to sustain R&amp;D budgets and complete planned training runs, producing a modest uptick in frontier development speed.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_rate_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_safety_race</data>
</edge>
