  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Expansionary central‑bank market operations (large liquidity injections/asset purchases) lower financing costs and spur portfolio rebalancing into real assets and commodities, lifting oil demand and prices in the near term.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_rate_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">gulf_energy_flashpoint</data>
</edge>
