<edge source="brics_alignment_growth::investment_divergence" target="ai_safety_race::safety_incident_freq" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Widening allocation gaps that divert safety‑related funding away from some developer communities reduce testing, red‑teaming and monitoring capacity there, raising the probability that deployed frontier models produce harmful or insecure behaviours.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">brics_alignment_growth</data>
