  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An accelerated rate of corporate capital and cash relocation across jurisdictions creates acute short-term funding and FX pressures (deposit shifts, higher FX demand), prompting central banks to expand market operations (liquidity injections, FX swaps or asset purchases) to stabilize funding markets.</data>
